Placeholder, for now.

 si        SI       erase word
                    erase the last Lojban word, treating non-Lojban text
                    as a single word

 sa        SA       erase utterance
                    erase complete or partial utterance; next word shows
                    how much erasing to do

 su        SU       erase discourse
                    erase to start of discourse or text; drop subject
                    or start over

-Robin